    "BrochureContent": [
      {
        "ContentType": "Description",
        "SortOrder": 0,
        "Content": "Somerville is a modern, small development of residential and 1 commercial unit that enjoys excellent town centre location. It overlooks Ramparts at one side and Marshes SC on the other, and quite simply cannot be beaten for location. It`s within walking distance of everything: shops, schools, bus and rail, sports clubs and much more. \n\nThis property is at first floor level and comes to market in excellent condition all freshly repainted and carpeted. \n\nIt boasts 2 double bedroom spaces, a fully tiled bathroom, a large and bright open plan kitchen - diner living room with sliding door onto a shared terrace. What a lovely space!\n\nCrucially for many of you, the property comes with 1 designated parking space. The development overall is in good order and well maintained and will appeal to a lot of property requirements. \n"
      },
